Change: `mem::take(c)` becomes `mem::replace(c, PlainPacketCodec::default())`.
Why: Aeneas models `core::mem::replace` but not `core::mem::take`.
Behaviour: Identical: std defines `mem::take(dest)` as `mem::replace(dest, T::default())`.

